silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_03_materialization_spine_sections_03_validate_step_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_validate_step #3', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'The Validate Step' the bare symbol CheckedArtifact anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
